WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:07.758
Kip walked

2
00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:12.224
home slowly. He was very sad.

3
00:00:12.225 --> 00:00:18.415
"Bird doesn't like me anymore," Kip

4
00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:23.972
thought. "I know!" Kip said.

5
00:00:23.973 --> 00:00:26.826
"I'll make nice cupcakes for Bird.

6
00:00:26.827 --> 00:00:32.322
Then she will like

7
00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:36.508
me again." Kip stirred the cake batter. He

8
00:00:36.509 --> 00:00:40.010
poured it into a pan. Then he

9
00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:45.093
put the pan in

10
00:00:45.094 --> 00:00:47.139
the oven. "Ha-ha!"

11
00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.063
Someone laughed. Kip looked up at

12
00:00:50.064 --> 00:01:04.935
Bird's nest. Bird and her mean friend

13
00:01:04.936 --> 00:01:14.583
were there. They were laughing together. Kip

14
00:01:14.584 --> 00:01:17.496
felt awful. Ding! The cupcakes

15
00:01:17.497 --> 00:01:27.333
were ready. Kip put them

16
00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:31.697
on a plate. "I hope

17
00:01:31.698 --> 00:01:34.329
Bird likes them," Kip

18
00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:38.732
said. Kip found red paint. He

19
00:01:38.733 --> 00:01:42.763
painted a heart. "For

20
00:01:42.764 --> 00:01:47.872
my good friend Bird," he

21
00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:51.363
wrote. Kip went back to

22
00:01:51.364 --> 00:01:54.515
the plate. Oh no!

23
00:01:54.516 --> 00:01:59.639
The cupcakes

24
00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:06.255
were missing! Kip

25
00:02:06.256 --> 00:02:09.879
looked up. Bird and her friend were eating

26
00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:14.496
Kip's cupcakes. Bird was smiling at

27
00:02:14.497 --> 00:02:18.499
the mean bird. "Thanks for

28
00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:29.781
making these cupcakes!" Bird said.

